{"articleNo":"472540","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=472540&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2023학년도 겨울계절학기 취업진로상담 교과목 시행안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2024.01.17","hit":"51159","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-size: 24pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-size: 24pt;\">학년도 겨울계절학기&nbsp;취업진로상담 교과목 시행안내</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">1. 개요<br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">-&nbsp;<b>2023학년 1학기 부터 시행(</b><b style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\">취업진로교육, 지도교수상담과 별개)</b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;-<b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;졸업요건에 반영되어 미이수시 졸업 불가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;- 졸업 전까지 4회 이수(건축학전공: 5회 이상)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">동일 학기에는 교과목 상담을 1회 이상하더라도 &nbsp;1회 인정(1학기 상담 2회 진행&nbsp; → 교과목 상담 1회 이수)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6674\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 1,\n\"dv\": 0,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.1\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"11, 0, 0, 7936\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_10\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2024-01-17T09:20:03.974Z\",\n\"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": false,\n\"aa\": false,\n\"ds\": false,\n\"de\": false,\n\"as\": false,\n\"cp\": false,\n\"ao\": false,\n\"et\": fals