t\": 0,\n\"au\": \"\",\n\"ap\": \"\",\n\"ac\": \")\",\n\"as\": false,\n\"ll\": -1,\n\"lt\": 1,\n\"lw\": 1,\n\"lc\": 0,\n\"sa\": 850,\n\"sb\": 567,\n\"st\": 283\n,\n\"nt\": 0,\n\"nn\": 1,\n\"pp\": 0,\n\"pb\": false\n},\n\"en\": {\n\"at\": 0,\n\"au\": \"\",\n\"ap\": \"\",\n\"ac\": \")\",\n\"as\": false,\n\"ll\": -4,\n\"lt\": 1,\n\"lw\": 1,\n\"lc\": 0,\n\"sa\": 850,\n\"sb\": 567,\n\"st\": 0\n,\n\"nt\": 0,\n\"nn\": 1,\n\"pp\": 0,\n\"pb\": false\n},\n\"pb\": [\n{\n\"ty\": 0,\n\"bf\": \"01DA48DAEB6DC14000000003\",\n\"tb\": true,\n\"hi\": false,\n\"fi\": false,\n\"fa\": 0,\n\"ol\": 1417,\n\"or\": 1417,\n\"ot\": 1417,\n\"ob\": 1417\n},\n{\n\"ty\": 1,\n\"bf\": \"01DA48DAEB6DC14000000003\",\n\"tb\": true,\n\"hi\": false,\n\"fi\": false,\n\"fa\": 0,\n\"ol\": 1417,\n\"or\": 1417,\n\"ot\": 1417,\n\"ob\": 1417\n},\n{\n\"ty\": 2,\n\"bf\": \"01DA48DAEB6DC14000000003\",\n\"tb\": true,\n\"hi\": false,\n\"fi\": false,\n\"fa\": 0,\n\"ol\": 1417,\n\"or\": 1417,\n\"ot\": 1417,\n\"ob\": 1417\n}\n],\n\"mp\": [ ]\n}\n,\n\"01DA48DAEB6DC14000000001\": {\n\"cc\": 2,\n\"ci\": 1668246628,\n\"ty\": 0,\n\"la\": 0,\n\"co\": 1,\n\"ss\": true,\n\"sg\": 0,\n\"lt\": 0,\n\"lw\": 0,\n\"lc\": 0,\n\"cs\": [ ]\n}\n},\n\"bi\": [ ],\n\"bidt\": { }\n}--></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;- 상담 또는 대체이수 중 선택하여 1년에 1회 참여 권장</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;- <b>상담</b>: 대학일자리플러스센터 또는&nbsp;학생상담센터에서 1회 이상 상담&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b>대체이수</b>: 학생성공처(대학일자리플러스센터, 취업지원팀, 학생상담센터)에서 진행하는 진로취업 프로그램 수료</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">(</span><u style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">프로그램 안내 시 대체이수 표시)</u><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">2. 주요내용</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;가. 적용대상: 전학년 <b>재학생</b>(계약학과, IT융합학과, 외국인유학생 및 시간제등록 학생 제외)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;나. 개설학기: 겨울 계절학기<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 216, 255);\">(2023.12.22. ~ 2024. 2.29.)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;다. 수강신청: 별도 수강신청 없음(원스톱서비스에서 수강신청 X)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;라. 교과목이수:&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">아래 3개의 방법 중 하나를 선택하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">학년별</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">1회</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">&nbsp;상담 권장</span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<b>대학일자리플러스센터</b>: 학생경력관리시스템(<a href=\"https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\">https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr</a>) 진로취업상담신청-상담진행(개인/집단상담)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<b>학생상담센터</b>: 학생상담센터 홈페이지(<a href=\"https://consult.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\">https://consult.kumoh.ac.kr</a>), 유선, 방문 신청-상담진행<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">(개인/집단상담</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; - <b>대체이수</b>:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">ONE-DAY 모의면접, 직무부트캠프</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;마. 성적처리: S/U&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;바. <b>성적확인</b>:&nbsp;</span><b style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">2024년 3월 중 이수확인 가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">원스톱서비스-취업진로상담-취업진로상담이수내역(졸업요건/상담횟수 확인)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">3.&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\">문의사항: 054)478-7987</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
